(footprint "TOUCH_PAD_12"
	(version 20241229)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "9.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "12 mm capacitive touch pad for the ESP32's touch peripheral. Copper only - the solder mask stays over it, which is a good dielectric and stops the copper tarnishing. Carries its own no-pour rule area on both layers: the ring isolates the pad from the ground pour, and the matching cut-out on the opposite layer keeps a plane from sitting right behind the sensor and swamping it.")
